[{"author_association":null,"body":"This test suite is not hermetic: `launchServer()` reads `process.env.GITLAB_TOKEN_TEST` and `process.env.TEST_PROJECT_ID` (and passes through `process.env.GITLAB_ALLOWED_PROJECT_IDS` unless explicitly overridden). As written, these tests will fail on environments where those vars aren’t set (or will behave differently if `GITLAB_ALLOWED_PROJECT_IDS` is set in the parent env). Consider setting/restoring `process.env.GITLAB_TOKEN_TEST` + `process.env.TEST_PROJECT_ID` in the `before/after` hooks, and explicitly setting `GITLAB_ALLOWED_PROJECT_IDS: ''` for the “No GITLAB_ALLOWED_PROJECT_IDS” case to override any inherited value.","body_updated_after_merge":true,"commit_id":"096169da7c2a66b6ac1d4bb2de697205ca7e8cfb","created_at":"2026-03-22T12:34:35Z","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,279 @@
+/**
