[{"author_association":null,"body":"The check `if (capabilities.HasCapability(NetCapability.Internet))` is redundant because the caller at line 177 already verifies this capability before calling `ProcessNetworkCapabilities`. If the capability is missing, execution continues at line 181, so this method is only called when `NetCapability.Internet` is present.

Consider removing the outer if-statement and keeping only the inner API level checks:

```csharp
void ProcessNetworkCapabilities(NetworkCapabilities capabilities)
{
    if (capabilities == null)
    {
        return;
    }

    // For API 23+, also check if network is validated for better accuracy
    // For API 21-22, just having Internet capability is sufficient
    if (OperatingSystem.IsAndroidVersionAtLeast(23))
    {
        if (capabilities.HasCapability(NetCapability.Validated))
        {
            currentAccess = IsBetterAccess(currentAccess, NetworkAccess.Internet);
        }
        else
        {
            // Has internet capability but not validated
            currentAccess = IsBetterAccess(currentAccess, NetworkAccess.ConstrainedInternet);
        }
    }
    else
    {
        // For API 21-22, assume internet capability means connected
        currentAccess = IsBetterAccess(currentAccess, NetworkAccess.Internet);
    }
}
```
```suggestion
						// For API 23+, also check if network is validated for better accuracy
						// For API 21-22, just having Internet capability is sufficient
						if (OperatingSystem.IsAndroidVersionAtLeast(23))
						{
							if (capabilities.HasCapability(NetCapability.Validated))
							{
								currentAccess = IsBetterAccess(currentAccess, NetworkAccess.Internet);
							}
							else
							{
								// Has internet capability but not validated (similar to IsConnectedOrConnecting)
								currentAccess = IsBetterAccess(currentAccess, NetworkAccess.ConstrainedInternet);
							}
						}
						else
						{
							// For API 21-22, assume internet capability means connected
							currentAccess = IsBetterAccess(currentAccess, NetworkAccess.Internet);
						}
```","body_updated_after_merge":false,"commit_id":"6d1ecb474d976cdf6eb979f927e57b8d6891b0fd","created_at":"2025-11-27T09:41:27Z","diff_hunk":"@@ -230,9 +227,42 @@ void ProcessNetworkInfo(NetworkInfo info)
