The problem is that the generated code now has `let _hx_tmp = super.test(_hx_continuation.completion)` inside a closure, which doesn't work. This is not a JS-specific problem and fails on other targets too. Also note that the `testOverridingCoroutine` test you have added to `TestCoroutines` does not cover this case because it doesn't have the `super.id()` call.

