[{"author_association":null,"body":"Using DateTime.Now for the archive cutoff can be inconsistent with how revisions are timestamped in the repository (UpsertAPIRevisionAsync sets LastUpdatedOn using DateTime.UtcNow). This can shift the cutoff by timezone/clock settings and lead to revisions being archived earlier/later than intended. Consider using DateTime.UtcNow for the cutoff computation to match persisted timestamps.
```suggestion
            var lastUpdatedDate = DateTime.UtcNow.Subtract(TimeSpan.FromDays(archiveAfterMonths * 30));
```","body_updated_after_merge":false,"commit_id":"605ac4fcc23d7c37faafe5ce6d459009ffd3e2eb","created_at":"2026-02-12T19:30:37Z","diff_hunk":"@@ -884,9 +885,53 @@ public async Task AutoArchiveAPIRevisions(int archiveAfterMonths)
