[{"author_association":null,"body":"**Bug: ItemDeselected causes spurious null during selection change.**

When the user taps a new item, UICollectionView fires ItemDeselected for the old item *before* ItemSelected for the new item. This means SelectedItem is briefly set to null, firing a spurious PropertyChanged event on every selection change.

Consider removing this handler entirely for Single mode. ItemSelected already handles setting the new selection, and UICollectionView handles visual deselection automatically.","body_updated_after_merge":false,"commit_id":"f75fb074432b2f8cbd0c56779d81605bf915580e","created_at":"2026-02-15T01:17:53Z","diff_hunk":"@@ -0,0 +1,257 @@
