+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+# From the repository root
+cd examples/basic
+npm install
+cd ../..
+
+# Run installed-check
+node cli-wrapper.cjs examples/basic
+```
+
+## Example Output
+
+This example passes all checks cleanly, demonstrating a correctly configured package.
+
