| Handler | Type | Behavior | Correct? | Tool Description Before | Fixed? |
|---------|------|----------|----------|------------------------|--------|
| `create_issue` | Creation | Auto-applies `title_prefix` | ✅ | ✅ "Title will be prefixed with..." | — |
| `create_discussion` | Creation | Auto-applies `title_prefix` | ✅ | ✅ "Title will be prefixed with..." | — |
| `create_pull_request` | Creation | Auto-applies `title_prefix` | ✅ | ✅ "Title will be prefixed with..." | — |
| `push_to_pull_request_branch` | Additive | Validates `title_prefix`, rejects if missing | ✅ | ❌ Missing | ✅ Added "The target pull request title must start with..." (a08a06a) |
| `update_issue` | Additive | Validates `title_prefix`, rejects if missing | ✅ | ❌ Missing | ✅ Added "The target issue title must start with..." (1f766b0) |
| `close_pull_request` | Filter | Only closes PRs with matching `required_title_prefix` | ✅ | ✅ "Only PRs with title prefix X can be closed." | — |
| `close_issue` | Filter | Only closes issues with matching `required_title_prefix` | ✅ | ❌ Missing (inconsistent with `close_pull_request`) | ✅ Added "Only issues with title prefix X can be closed." (1f766b0) |
| `close_discussion` | Filter | Only closes discussions with matching `required_title_prefix` | ✅ | ❌ Missing | ✅ Added "Only discussions with title prefix X can be closed." (1f766b0) |
| `link_sub_issue` | Additive/Filter | Validates `parent_title_prefix` and `sub_title_prefix` | ✅ | ❌ Missing | ✅ Added parent and sub constraints (1f766b0) |
