The path comparison logic here is a bit complex and contains redundant checks. The `strpos()`/`stripos()` checks with appended directory separators already handle exact matches, making the `===` and `strcasecmp()` checks unnecessary. On Windows, the case-sensitive check is also redundant.

This logic can be simplified for better readability and to remove the redundant operations.

```php
        $is_windows = DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR === '\';
        if ( $is_windows ) {
            if ( 0 === stripos( $path . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR, $allowed . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR ) ) {
                return true;
            }
        } elseif ( 0 === strpos( $path . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR, $allowed . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR ) ) {
            return true;
        }
```", "body_updated_after_merge": false, "date_basis": "max(created_at,parent_review.submitted_at)", "event_at": "2026-01-15T23:38:56Z", "event_key": "pr_review_comments:3804149395:a0da0b82281b4d3aa10db5013e663286b97723e5ea6c91f25dddfe5d40167b1b:1", "parent_review_event_key": "pr_reviews:3804149395:8e9af3224e9c42e69f0537351c89cf95fd1189a7152b5a556af92c36f959b432:1", "request_at": "2026-01-12T16:47:42Z", "request_event_key": "pr_timeline:3804149395:b930a646157958a6a658756867f47eafbbaa90d5d2d4affa002f13bd0f80049d:1", "review_state": null, "role_proxy": "non_author_user", "source_event_at": "2026-01-15T21:47:39Z", "source_table": "pr_review_comments", "source_url": "https://github.com/wp-cli/wp-cli/pull/6192#discussion_r2696075987"}, {"actor": "swissspidy", "body": null, "body_updated_after_merge": null, "date_basis": "submitted_at", "event_at": "2026-01-15T23:38:56Z", "event_key": "pr_reviews:3804149395:8e9af3224e9c42e69f0537351c89cf95fd1189a7152b5a556af92c36f959b432:1", "parent_review_event_key": null, "request_at": "2026-01-12T16:47:42Z", "request_event_key": "pr_timeline:3804149395:b930a646157958a6a658756867f47eafbbaa90d5d2d4affa002f13bd0f80049d:1", "review_state": "COMMENTED", "role_proxy": "non_author_user", "source_event_at": "2026-01-15T23:38:56Z", "source_table": "pr_reviews", "source_url": "https://github.com/wp-cli/wp-cli/pull/6192#pullrequestreview-3667735452"}, {"actor": "swissspidy", "body": "@copilot tests now fail with this:

