[{"author_association":null,"body":"The path comparison on line 248 uses case-sensitive `strpos()`, which may cause issues on Windows where filesystem paths are case-insensitive. For example, if `open_basedir` is set to `C:\Users\Example` but the actual path is `c:\users\example`, the comparison will fail even though these paths refer to the same location on Windows.

Consider using case-insensitive comparison on Windows systems:

```
$is_windows = DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR === '\\';
if ( $path === $allowed || 
     ( $is_windows && strcasecmp( $path, $allowed ) === 0 ) ||
     0 === strpos( $path . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR, $allowed . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR ) ||
     ( $is_windows && 0 === stripos( $path . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR, $allowed . DIRECTORY_SEPARATOR ) ) ) {
    return true;
}
```

